---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
const title = 'Tanka — Money for everyday life';
const description = 'Tanka is an open-source cryptocurrency project developing an independent, mineable digital currency designed for everyday payments and community participation.';
---
<SiteLayout title={title} description={description}>
  <section class="relative isolate min-h-[690px] overflow-hidden pt-16 md:min-h-[740px] md:pt-24">
    <div class="grid-lines absolute inset-0 -z-10"></div>
    <div class="container grid items-center gap-6 lg:grid-cols-[1.03fr_.97fr]">
      <div class="rise max-w-[610px] pb-12 lg:pb-28">
        <div class="mb-8 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-cyan/25 bg-cyan/[.06] px-3 py-2 text-[.66rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[.14em] text-cyan"><span class="size-1.5 animate-pulse rounded-full bg-cyan"></span> An open project in development</div>
        <h1 class="display max-w-[650px] text-[3.6rem] font-semibold leading-[.99] text-white sm:text-7xl lg:text-[5.35rem]">Money for<br /><span class="text-cyan">everyday life.</span></h1>
        <p class="mt-7 text-sm font-medium tracking-[.1em] text-silver sm:text-base">Mine it. Send it. Spend it.</p>
        <p class="mt-5 max-w-[510px] text-[.98rem] leading-7 text-silver/68">Tanka is an open-source cryptocurrency project developing an independent, mineable digital currency designed for everyday payments and community participation.</p>
        <div class="mt-9 flex flex-wrap gap-3"><a class="button-primary" href="/about/">Discover Tanka <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="button-secondary" href="https://github.com/serviceontheweb/tanka">View the project on GitHub <span aria-hidden="true" class="ml-2">↗</span></a></div>
        <p class="mt-7 text-[.69rem] text-silver/45">The network and payment tools are in development. Nothing here is an offer to buy or sell a digital asset.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rise-delay relative mx-auto flex aspect-square w-full max-w-[550px] items-center justify-center lg:-mt-2">
        <div class="absolute inset-[6%] rounded-full border border-cyan/[.12]"></div><div class="absolute inset-[15%] rounded-full border border-silver/[.12]"></div><div class="absolute inset-[24%] rounded-full border border-cyan/[.16]" style="animation: orbit 32s linear infinite"><span class="absolute left-[8%] top-[19%] size-2 rounded-full bg-cyan shadow-[0_0_16px_#12DCE6]"></span></div>
        <div class="absolute h-[70%] w-[70%] rounded-full bg-cyan/[.08] blur-[70px]"></div>
        <div class="glow relative grid size-[46%] place-items-center rounded-full border border-cyan/35 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_35%_25%,rgba(18,220,230,.2),rgba(15,35,66,.96)_63%)]">
          <div class="absolute inset-[9%] rounded-full border border-cyan/25"></div>
          <svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" role="img" aria-label="Tanka geometric symbol" class="relative w-[44%] drop-shadow-[0_0_22px_rgba(18,220,230,.25)]"><circle cx="50" cy="50" r="45" fill="none" stroke="#12DCE6" stroke-width="3"/><path d="M48 25H25v10h13v40h10V25Zm4 0h23v10H62v40H52V25Z" fill="#12DCE6"/><path d="M52 25h23v10H62v40H52V25Z" fill="#BAC8D6"/></svg>
          <span class="absolute -bottom-8 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-midnight/90 px-3 py-1.5 text-[.58rem] uppercase tracking-[.2em] text-silver/65">A currency for people</span>
        </div>
        <div class="panel absolute right-[1%] top-[22%] rounded-xl px-4 py-3 shadow-2xl shadow-black/20"><div class="text-[.56rem] uppercase tracking-[.16em] text-silver/45">Open by design</div><div class="mt-1 text-xs font-medium text-silver">Community-led development</div></div>
        <div class="panel absolute bottom-[15%] left-[1%] rounded-xl px-4 py-3 shadow-2xl shadow-black/20"><div class="text-[.56rem] uppercase tracking-[.16em] text-silver/45">Current chapter</div><div class="mt-1 flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-medium text-silver"><span class="size-1.5 rounded-full bg-cyan"></span>Building the foundations</div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="container pb-12"><div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-[.64rem] uppercase tracking-[.2em] text-silver/40"><span class="h-px w-12 bg-cyan/50"></span> An independent idea. Built in the open.</div></div>
  </section>
  <section class="relative border-y border-white/[.07] bg-[#09152b]/70 py-20">
    <div class="container"><div class="mb-12 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-[.8fr_1.2fr] md:items-end"><div><p class="eyebrow">The intention</p><h2 class="display mt-3 text-3xl font-medium sm:text-4xl">Digital money, with<br />everyday people in mind.</h2></div><p class="max-w-xl text-sm leading-7 text-silver/62">Tanka is being developed as an independent, mineable digital currency. The work is early, open, and grounded in a simple question: how can digital money feel useful in daily life?</p></div>
      <div class="grid gap-3 md:grid-cols-3">
        <article class="panel rounded-2xl p-6"><span class="eyebrow">01 / Open</span><h3 class="display mt-9 text-xl">Built in public</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-silver/60">Source code and project progress are shared openly so people can follow along and participate.</p><a href="https://github.com/serviceontheweb/tanka" class="mt-6 inline-block text-xs font-semibold text-cyan">Visit the project ↗</a></article>
        <article class="panel rounded-2xl p-6"><span class="eyebrow">02 / Independent</span><h3 class="display mt-9 text-xl">A project of its own</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-silver/60">Tanka is an independent open-source effort, developed with community participation at its core.</p><a href="/about/" class="mt-6 inline-block text-xs font-semibold text-cyan">Our principles ↗</a></article>
        <article class="panel rounded-2xl p-6"><span class="eyebrow">03 / Practical</span><h3 class="display mt-9 text-xl">Designed for daily use</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-silver/60">The long-term aim is straightforward: explore a digital currency that can serve everyday payments.</p><a href="/roadmap/" class="mt-6 inline-block text-xs font-semibold text-cyan">See the roadmap ↗</a></article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="container py-20"><div class="panel relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-12"><div class="absolute -right-20 -top-28 size-80 rounded-full bg-cyan/[.08] blur-[80px]"></div><div class="relative grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] md:items-center"><div><p class="eyebrow">Follow the work</p><h2 class="display mt-3 text-3xl font-medium">The next chapter is open.</h2><p class="mt-3 max-w-xl text-sm leading-6 text-silver/60">Explore the code, follow development, and join the conversation as Tanka takes shape.</p></div><a class="button-primary" href="/community/">Meet the community ↗</a></div></div></section>
</SiteLayout>
